    "step": "trials_and_travails",
    "source": "Rogue Trader Core Rulebook + Into the Storm",
    "status": "Core reconciled-by-hand from Core book pp.28-30. Into the Storm 'New Trials and Travails Options' reconciled from ItS pp.23-25 (printed folios; PDF pages 24-26). Verify vs errata.",
    "scope": "Core options (Hand of War/Press-ganged/Calamity/Ship-lorn/Dark Voyage/High Vendetta), where both listed effects are always received (Core p.28) and internal 'choose one' picks are choices, plus the nine Into the Storm advanced Trials & Travails picks. ItS groups three sub-options under each broad heading (Darkness / A Product of Upbringing / Lost Worlds); each concrete sub-option is its own selectable record carrying its printed xp_cost (ItS p.23: they 'work identically to the Lure of the Void options ... in terms of Experience Point costs'), named 'Heading - Option'. The broad heading 'may be taken instead of' two Core options (recorded as substitutes_for). XP costs verified against ItS page text AND the AllowStorm-gated Excel StormTrialsOptionList (all nine match). ItS Advanced Origins is the human path, so each ItS pick requires species Human.",
    "open_skill_items": "Several options grant 'a Skill of your choice' / 'a Common Lore' / 'a Forbidden Lore' / 'an Exploration skill' that the engine cannot pre-enumerate; modelled as a grant_skill with a placeholder skill name the UI must resolve.",
    "rules_qa": [
      "Provenance pages are PRINTED FOLIOS (ItS folio = PDF page index - 1).",
      "Darkness (instead of The Hand of War or High Vendetta) -> Forbidden Knowledge 200 (Common Lore (any one)+Forbidden Lore (any one) trained; Paranoia+Enemy), Warp Incursion 100 (Resistance (Psychic Powers)+Light Sleeper; 1d5 Corruption), Dark Secret 200 (+6 to any one Characteristic; 1d5 Insanity).",
      "A Product of Upbringing (instead of Press-Ganged or Ship Lorn) -> New Blood 200 (Rival (Nobility); +1 Profit Factor), Rivals 100 (+3 Fel; Rival talent; Peer talent), Decadent 150 (+3 WP; Decadence; +5 Charm bonus; 1d5 Corruption).",
      "Lost Worlds (instead of Calamity or Dark Voyage) -> Lost Dynasty 400 (+1 Profit Factor; +1 Fate), Rogue Planet 200 (+3 WP; one Exploration skill trained; 1d5 Insanity), Beyond the Pale 100 (1d5 Corruption + 1d5 Insanity; two Forbidden Lore trained).",
      "Dark Secret's '+6 to any one Characteristic' is modelled as a char_mod_choice with amount 6, pool 'any' (a one-off +6, not an Advance).",
      "Beyond the Pale 'two Forbidden Lore' modelled as two nested choices sharing distinct_group 'beyond_the_pale_lores' over the enumerated Forbidden Lore specialisation list (Core p.117) so the engine forbids picking the same Lore twice (the two must differ).",
      "New Blood's Excel cost 200 matches the book; the Excel row name is 'New Blood' (the broad heading is 'A Product of Upbringing')."
    ],
